# The magician's opening attack, and a weak one: four bolts of 18+3x% come to
# 84% against a single target at first, under the bare poke, and reach 312% at
# max. It still wins from the first point on a crowded map, because it hits
# four; the poke only takes over on the last mob standing. Faithful to GMS,
# where a magician's damage arrives with the second job.
